# Keep private recordings and local state out of the image build context.
# The Dockerfile COPYs pyproject.toml, app/, and (Option A) the one authorized
# reference at deploy/reference/voice-ref.wav. Everything else with private
# audio is excluded; the reference is re-included explicitly below.
.env
.git
.gitignore
__pycache__/
*.pyc
data/
models/
voice-reference/
voices/
*.wav
*.mp3
P2*-REPORT.md
tests/
# Option A: the authorized reference is baked into the PRIVATE image at the
# runtime path. It is git-ignored and only ever included in the private build.
!deploy/reference/voice-ref.wav
